{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet Faye and Kun in this  demo.</strong><br>Faye is a rogue with nowhere left to run. Kun is a priest weighed down by expectations he never asked for. When fate throws them together, their clashing personalities may become their greatest strength or their undoing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover hidden truths, shape their relationship through choice-driven dialogue, and begin to form a party that just might survive what\u2019s coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers <strong>2\u20133 hours of story-rich gameplay</strong> with <strong>multiple endings</strong>, giving you a taste of the journey ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 <strong>A Character-Driven Story</strong> \u2013 Experience the tension and connection between two complex leads.<br>\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Choices That Matter</strong> \u2013 Shape Faye and Kun\u2019s relationship and future through your dialogue decisions.<br>\ud83c\udf12 <strong>A World in Transition</strong> \u2013 Step into a fantasy realm teetering between mystery, conflict, and change.<br>\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your path through the demo branches based on how you engage with the story.<br>\u23f3 <strong>2\u20133 Hours of Play</strong> \u2013 A compact, complete experience with room for replay.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bad Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661420/8086ed8152f3e10bbaa2f612128a2589d6354800.jpg"},{"name":"Normal Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661420/7ce37bd8d547c1fc4cc5b9a258504d64881a637b.jpg"},{"name":"Good Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661420/edce5006e813ce21d4471a008866fcd17aec723d.jpg"},{"name":"Goblin Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3661420/dbffe